<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑδώλι-ον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>seat</i>, mostly pl.,
			<i>abodes</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πωλικά, νυμφικά</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				455
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				71
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχαιόπλουτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					1393
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				566
			</span></i>: Com. phrase, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κριβάνων ἑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					155
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑδώλια, τά</span>, in a ship, a <i>raised quarter-deck</i> at
			the stern, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1277
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				238
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1571
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				296
			</span></i>; expld. as <i>rowers' benches</i> by <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				153.35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> sg., <i>step
				of the mast</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mech.</u>
				851a40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in a
			theatre, <i>semicircle of benches</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.132
			</span></i> (on the breathing, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				317.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδ</span>- in codd. of <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> ll.cc.).</div>
